{"step_index":589,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-22T04:13:16Z","thinking":"Focusing on the \"blue\" color previously worked on, need to determine its precise RGB/theme value from the group analysis.  Examining the \"Font\" section shows FFFF0000 is red, so that's not it. The \"Fill\" section has several options for blue variants (theme:8, theme:9, theme:5); must check those values. Will examine the `scan_biz_col_colors.js` output, and may need to modify the script to ensure the correct values are shown.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"node -e \"\nconst ExcelJS = require('C:/Users/lg/.gemini/antigravity/worktrees/resilient-bardeen/add_undo_game_studio/node_modules/exceljs');\nasync function test() {\n  const xlsxPath = 'C:/Users/lg/Desktop/Today/(안상숙)(STI)_(모집단현행화)_부산정보산업진흥원_2026_부산_CT산업_실태조사_260910_크레탑_배현명.xlsx';\n  const wb = new ExcelJS.Workbook();\n  await wb.xlsx.readFile(xlsxPath);\n  const ws = wb.getWorksheet('기업체 리스트') || wb.worksheets[0];\n  \n  const blueItems = [];\n  ws.eachRow((r, rNum) => {\n    if (rNum === 1) return;\n    const bizCell = r.getCell(4);\n    const fill = bizCell.fill;\n    const font = bizCell.font;\n    \n    // Check if fill is theme 8, 9, or blue argb\n    let isBlue = false;\n    let type = '';\n    if (fill && fill.fgColor) {\n      const t = fill.fgColor.theme;\n      const a = fill.fgColor.argb;\n      if (t === 8 || t === 9 || t === 5 || (a && (a.includes('0070C0') || a.includes('00B0F0') || a.includes('D9E1F2') || a.includes('4F81BD')))) {\n        isBlue = true;\n        type = 'fill(theme:' + t + ',argb:' + a + ')';\n      }\n    }\n    if (font && font.color) {\n      const a = font.color.argb;\n      const t = font.color.theme;\n      if ((a && (a.includes('0070C0') || a.includes('00B0F0') || a.includes('0000FF') || a.includes('4F81BD') || a.includes('2F5597'))) || t === 4 || t === 8 || t === 9) {\n        // Only if not black\n        if (a !== 'FF000000') {\n          isBlue = true;\n          type += ' font(' + a + ',t:' + t + ')';\n        }\n      }\n    }\n    \n    if (isBlue) {\n      blueItems.push({\n        rNum,\n        seq: r.getCell(2).value,\n        name: r.getCell(3).value,\n        biz: bizCell.value,\n        type,\n        s24: r.getCell(17).value,\n        s25: r.getCell(18).value\n      });\n    }\n  });\n  \n  console.log('Total blue items on BizCell:', blueItems.length);\n  // List them\n  blueItems.forEach((b, i) => {\n    console.log('[' + (i+1) + '] R' + b.rNum + ' (Seq ' + b.seq + ') ' + b.name + ' | Biz: ' + b.biz + ' | ' + b.type + ' | S24: ' + b.s24 + ' | S25: ' + b.s25);\n  });\n}\ntest();\n\"","Cwd":"C:\\Users\\lg\\.gemini\\antigravity\\worktrees\\resilient-bardeen\\add_undo_game_studio","IsDaemon":false,"WaitMsBeforeAsync":5000,"toolAction":"Testing blue colors on BizCell","toolSummary":"Run blue test script"}}]}
